    mac80211_hwsim: Replace bogus hrtimer clockid
    =

    mac80211_hwsim initializes a hrtimer with clockid CLOCK_MONOTONIC_RAW.
    That's not supported.
    =

    Use CLOCK_MONOTNIC instead.
    =

